WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.308 --> 00:00:04.147
(cell phone rings)

00:00:04.969 --> 00:00:06.640
- Hello?
- [Voiceover] Hi Quinta.

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:08.034
- Oh hi, Britney.

00:00:08.034 --> 00:00:09.379
Why are you talking so weird?

00:00:09.379 --> 00:00:11.308
- [Britney] I'm happy.

00:00:12.169 --> 00:00:16.042
- Happy, why?
- [Britney] I'm engaged.

00:00:18.321 --> 00:00:19.583
- [Voiceover] It's an epidemic.

00:00:19.583 --> 00:00:21.951
- Guys, come check this out.

00:00:21.951 --> 00:00:24.425
- It's happening to everyone.

00:00:24.425 --> 00:00:25.813
Just look around you.

00:00:28.072 --> 00:00:29.627
- This is pretty scary, you guys.

00:00:29.627 --> 00:00:31.461
- This is nuts.
- This is B.S.

00:00:31.461 --> 00:00:33.844
Not everyone is getting married, you guys.

00:00:33.844 --> 00:00:35.834
(knock on door)
I've got it.

00:00:46.107 --> 00:00:47.307
- What's wrong?

00:00:47.307 --> 00:00:49.983
- It's my brother, he's engaged.

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:51.268
(cries)

00:00:52.835 --> 00:00:54.889
- I'm so scared.

00:00:54.889 --> 00:00:56.300
- He was so young.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:58.249
- He hadn't even been to a strip club yet.

00:00:58.249 --> 00:00:59.411
- I don't want to buy a wedding gift,

00:00:59.411 --> 00:01:01.664
or an engagement gift, it's too expensive.

00:01:01.664 --> 00:01:02.987
- [Woman in Glasses]
I'm losing my friends,

00:01:02.987 --> 00:01:05.773
I feel like I'm going crazy, I'm so alone.

00:01:05.773 --> 00:01:08.443
- Do you think Zach's been
acting kind of strange?

00:01:08.443 --> 00:01:10.092
- Hold on babe, I've gotta tie my shoe.

00:01:10.092 --> 00:01:12.669
- OK
- What is this?

00:01:12.669 --> 00:01:14.063
No no no no, this isn't mine.

00:01:14.063 --> 00:01:17.179
No, No! Ahhhh!

00:01:19.256 --> 00:01:20.279
- [Zach] Are we gonna
have to do the Macarena

00:01:20.279 --> 00:01:22.206
at the reception?
- [Man] I don't know!

00:01:22.206 --> 00:01:23.189
- [Zach] I don't know how to do...

00:01:23.189 --> 00:01:24.457
- [Man] Well learn it!

00:01:24.457 --> 00:01:26.269
- Why is this happening?

00:01:26.269 --> 00:01:27.754
(breathes heavily)

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:31.259
(extended beep)

00:01:40.014 --> 00:01:42.453
- How long before it's you?

00:01:42.453 --> 00:01:46.707
♫ Here comes the bride,

00:01:46.707 --> 00:01:51.501
♫ all dressed in white ♫

00:01:52.437 --> 00:01:54.086
Will you marry me?

00:01:54.086 --> 00:01:55.914
Will you? (gasps)

00:01:59.322 --> 00:02:02.833
(upbeat music)

